<title>USA: Meteor gets $500,000 in court settlement.</title>
<headline>Meteor gets $500,000 in court settlement.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meteor Industries Inc on Wednesday said it would receive $500,000 as part of a court settlement with a former insurer.</p>
<p>The company, which markets petroleum products, said it would receive $500,000 in cash after paying related attorneys' fees.</p>
<p>Its shares fell 9/16 to 4-13/16 on Wednesday.</p>
